28
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:24,380
Either failure of an individual
application component or

29
00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:28,462
as part of a single physical node fails.

30
00:02:28,462 --> 00:02:32,482
And this is where Kubernetes comes in.

